Hey, it would be great to have consistency between the mautrix packages, meaning that all of them use the same version scheme.
I'm open for alternatives, but they should effect every mautrix package.
```suggestion
buildGoModule rec {
  pname = "mautrix-telegram";
  version = "26.04";
  tag = "v0.2604.0";

  src = fetchFromGitHub {
    owner = "mautrix";
    repo = "telegram";
    inherit tag;
```

