review_comments.body:
Why are you removing envsubst? We need it for example for ENCRYPTION_PICKLE_KEY:

```nix
services.mautrix-telegram = {
  settings = {
    encryption = {
      pickle_key = "$MAUTRIX_TELEGRAM_ENCRYPTION_PICKLE_KEY";
      ...
    };
    ...
  };
  ...
};
```

Maybe do preStart like in mautrix-whatsapp (already go version): https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/eb14681ee6e3e73a7c51564d512fc814d45e3059/nixos/modules/services/matrix/mautrix-whatsapp.nix#L200-L232

